},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"生气时别靠打沙袋、跑一圈来发泄，先让身体慢下来"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-24","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"心里压着一件事，可以连着几天把想法和感受写下来，但别指望它治病"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-25","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"痛经就吃布洛芬这类止痛药，别硬扛；痛到耽误上班上学、吃三个月药也压不住，就去妇科查"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-26","className":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"长期失眠（一周三晚以上、拖了三个月以上）先做失眠的认知行为治疗，别一上来就长期吃安眠药"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-27","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"打鼾很响、有人看见你睡着时憋气、白天困到开车都想睡的，去医院做睡眠监测查睡眠呼吸暂停，中重度的夜里戴呼吸机"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/03"},"children":["第 3 章 · 不要浪费精力"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"03-26"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["26"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["长期失眠（一周三晚以上、拖了三个月以上）先做失眠的认知行为治疗，别一上来就长期吃安眠药"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["做完这套治疗，入睡平均快约 19 分钟，半夜醒着的时间少约 26 分钟。效果会慢慢变弱，但 12 个月后还在。网上的自助课程和当面做的效果差不多。安眠药对 60 岁以上的人帮助小，每 6 人吃药就有 1 人出副作用，每 13 人才有 1 人睡好。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["去医院的睡眠门诊、精神科或心理科做，要花挂号费和治疗费。网上的自助课程便宜得多。一个疗程一般 6 到 8 周，每天要记睡眠日记。自己就能先做的是刺激控制：困了才上床，躺着睡不着就起床。床只用来睡觉和性生活，每天同一时间起床，白天不打盹。难在睡眠限制那一步：头几周要把躺床时间压短，白天会更困。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["国家卫健委 2020 年的诊疗规范按国际分类写了失眠障碍的诊断要点。一是入睡难、睡着后容易醒或者早醒。二是白天累、困，做事受影响。三是这些情况每周至少 3 次、持续至少 3 个月。不到 3 个月的叫短期失眠障碍。规范把失眠的认知行为治疗定为一线治疗。它包括睡眠限制、刺激控制、认知治疗、放松训练和睡眠…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：长期失眠（一周三晚以上、拖了三个月以上）先做失眠的认知行为治疗，别一上来就长期吃安眠药"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-boo